title: "cross-dataset-drp-paper: reproducible analysis for cross-dataset generalization in drug response prediction"
abstract: "Code and post-processing pipeline reproducing the figures, tables, and statistics for the IMPROVE cross-study analysis (CSA) benchmarking study of community drug response prediction models."
